	"abilities": [
		"Velocity-sensitive drum notes",
		"Sequencer MIDI output",
		"Configurable drum note map"
	],
	"hardwareControls": [
		"Ten instrument pads",
		"Color variations",
		"Roller/Looper strip",
		"Step sequencer"
	],
	"notice": "Connect USB MIDI or DIN MIDI out. Drum notes use the manual factory map (36-45), with Color variants at 48-53 and 55-57; Cowbell has no Color variant. MIDI channel and note assignments can be changed in MIDI Control Center; use MIDI learn to match them. Analog sound knobs do not send MIDI CC. Roller/Looper and transport messages are configurable and have no fixed mapping in this profile.",
